        <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#546779', lineHeight: 1.7, width: 900 }}>录入、绑定、核对、选入——每一步都有对应的检查位置。</Text>

        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', marginTop: 10 }}>
